d T4 are completely gone\n2. Only 2 T2 remaining (1 in unshown), making a pung unlikely\n3. It doesn't contribute to any viable winning pattern\n4. Discarding T2 allows me to focus on the T5-T6-T7-T8-T9 sequence potential and the J2 pair\n\nAnswer: Play T2"}
