 isolated with no connection to my Bamboo sequence structure. Discarding W5 keeps my strong Bamboo tiles (T5-T9) intact, allowing me to wait for tiles to complete either T5-T6-T7 or T6-T7-T8 chows while maintaining T7-T8-T9 potential. The J2 pair gives me flexibility. This maximizes my winning chances with multiple possible draws.\n\nAnswer: Play W5"}
